hub=The green bottle is quite safe. The unlabelled one stays on the shelf.
quest.title=Measure Twice, Brew Once
quest.description=Build Orin a laboratory where townsfolk can brew expedition supplies.
quest.objective.token=Collect the laboratory plot token from Orin.
quest.objective.build=Build the laboratory.
quest.objective.talk=Return to Orin.
bye=See you later.
how=Tell me about your work.
offer=Would you like to open a laboratory here?
finish=The laboratory is ready.
progress=About your laboratory...
accept=Let us build it.
later=Perhaps later.
offer.body=I could use a proper brewing hall, a little ingredient pantry, and somewhere to keep my notes. Your townsfolk can learn to brew health, stamina and energy potions. Better recipes will need practiced hands and better benches.
accepted.body=Take this laboratory plan. Leave room around the alchemy benches for the brewers and their deliveries.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the laboratory is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=The benches are ready. Speak to me about workplace upgrades to unlock Alchemy. Mark a brewing workplace, choose its recipes and enable Alchemy in the town journal. Our couriers will bring the ingredients.
how.body=Every brewing task lists its ingredients, skill level and required alchemy bench tier. Stock the ingredients in town storage and enable Logistics for deliveries. A brewer must work at the bench to finish a potion. Finished batches go to Crafted Goods in the warehouse and brewing pauses when that storage is full.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
gift_love=What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like=Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral=Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike=I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.
building.name=Laboratory
token.name=Laboratory Plot
token.description=Stake a plot for a laboratory.
greeting.0=The green bottle is quite safe. The unlabelled one stays on the shelf.
greeting.1=Good ingredients, careful measures, and a clean bench. That is most of the secret.
greeting.2=An expedition goes better with a few remedies packed.
gift_love_birthday=You remembered my birthday! What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like_birthday=You remembered my birthday! Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral_birthday=You remembered my birthday! Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike_birthday=You remembered my birthday! I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.

reward.25=A careful brewer keeps every measure close at hand. Take this case for one of your Apprentices. Equip it through their profile to help them brew more quickly.
reward.50=Let us equip the rest of your brewers. I have shared the plans for my case with the town. Choose Browse all recipes at an alchemy workplace to find them.
reward.75=I trust you with my most demanding formula. It draws on the strongest alchemical plants to form a Shard of Gaia. Find it under Browse all recipes at an alchemy workplace. It needs an expert brewer and a fully improved bench.
